This set of tests runs by comparing various embed dimensions with different alpha and gamma levels for the Focal Loss
The more embed dimensions, the more features that are recorded at the end of the training sequence
The varying gamma levels dictates how hard the model is on overbalanced classes and how lenient it is on underbalanced
Alpha is a sort of weighting mechanism for how tolerant it is to helping underbalanced classes

(for ander) This represents Version1-12 in Tensorboard. Version_0 is the base config template run.